        {
          "flow": [
            {
              "id": 10,
              "module": "google-email:sendAnEmail",
              "version": 4,
              "parameters": {},
              "mapper": {
                "to": [
                  "{{1.`5`}}"
                ],
                "subject": "did u take a look at this yet?",
                "bodyType": "rawHtml",
                "content": "<p>Hi there,</p>\n<p>Made you a website. Here is the demo:<br>\n<a href=\"{{2.demo_link}}\">{{2.demo_link}}</a></p>\n<p>It loads fast, works on mobile, and looks like somewhere people trust, so more visitors turn into calls. It also texts and emails every new lead the moment they enquire, so you reply first, before your competition gets back to them. That is speed to lead, and it is where most local businesses lose jobs.</p>\n<p>No crazy monthly hosting fees either.</p>\n<p>Like it? Book a quick call here:<br>\n<a href=\"{{2.booking_link}}\">{{2.booking_link}}</a></p>\n<p>{{2.sender_name}}<br>\n{{2.sender_phone}}</p>",
                "attachments": []
              },
              "metadata": {
                "designer": {
                  "name": "Template 1"
                }
              },
              "filter": {
                "name": "template 1",
                "conditions": [
                  [
                    {
                      "a": "{{1.`__ROW_NUMBER__` - 6 * floor(1.`__ROW_NUMBER__` / 6)}}",
                      "b": "0",
                      "o": "number:equal"
